reground/5\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"px-5 sm:px-6 py-2 sm:py-2.5 bg-primary text-white rounded-xl text-sm font-medium hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm\" href=\"/contact\">Book</a></div><button class=\"lg:hidden text-foreground p-2\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu \"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"min-h-screen\"><div class=\"min-h-screen pt-24 pb-16\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\" style=\"opacity:0\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display font-bold mb-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\">Culinary Insights</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-foreground-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\">Stories, tips &amp; expertise from Chef Adrian&#x27;s kitchen</p></div><div class=\"mb-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/science-of-longevity\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all group shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted\">The Science of Longevity: How Food Affects Your Healthspan</span></div><div class=\"p-8\"><span class=\"text-primary text-sm font-medium\">Longevity Science</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-display font-bold mt-2 mb-4 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">The Science of Longevity: How Food Affects Your Healthspan</h2><p class=\"text-foreground-muted mb-6\">Discover the cutting-edge research on how specific nutrients and eating patterns can extend not just lifespan, but healthspan.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-sm text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user \"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span>Chef Adrian</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>8<!-- --> min read</span></div><span>10 January 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/intermittent-fasting-guide\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">Intermittent Fasting: A Chef&#x27;s Guide to Time-Restricted Eating</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Longevity Science</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">Intermittent Fasting: A Chef&#x27;s Guide to Time-Restricted Eating</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">How to implement intermittent fasting while maintaining culinary excellence and optimal nutrition.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>7<!-- --> min</span></div><span>15 January 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/anti-inflammatory-cooking\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">Anti-Inflammatory Cooking: Recipes for Cellular Health</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Nutrition &amp; Health</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">Anti-Inflammatory Cooking: Recipes for Cellular Health</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">Master the art of creating delicious meals that fight chronic inflammation and support cellular repair.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>6<!-- --> min</span></div><span>20 January 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/mediterranean-okinawan-fusion\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">The Mediterranean-Okinawan Fusion: Best of Both Blue Zones</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Longevity Science</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">The Mediterranean-Okinawan Fusion: Best of Both Blue Zones</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">Combining the wisdom of the two healthiest cuisines on Earth for optimal longevity.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>7<!-- --> min</span></div><span>25 January 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/omega-3-masterclass\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">Omega-3 Masterclass: Sourcing and Preparing Fatty Fish</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Cooking Techniques</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">Omega-3 Masterclass: Sourcing and Preparing Fatty Fish</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">Everything you need to know about selecting, storing, and cooking omega-3 rich fish for maximum health benefits.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>8<!-- --> min</span></div><span>28 January 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/sulforaphane-superfood\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">Sulforaphane: Why Broccoli Sprouts Are a Longevity Superfood</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Longevity Science</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">Sulforaphane: Why Broccoli Sprouts Are a Longevity Superfood</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">The science behind sulforaphane and how to maximize its benefits through proper preparation.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>6<!-- --> min</span></div><span>1 February 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/gut-brain-connection\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">Gut-Brain Connection: Fermented Foods for Cognitive Health</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Nutrition &amp; Health</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">Gut-Brain Connection: Fermented Foods for Cognitive Health</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">How fermented foods support your gut microbiome and enhance brain function through the gut-brain axis.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>7<!-- --> min</span></div><span>5 February 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/circadian-nutrition\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">Circadian Nutrition: When You Eat Matters as Much as What</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Longevity Science</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">Circadian Nutrition: When You Eat Matters as Much as What</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">Optimize your health by aligning your eating patterns with your body&#x27;s natural rhythms.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><span>7<!-- --> min</span></div><span>10 February 2024</span></div></div></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)\"><a href=\"/articles/art-of-plating\"><div class=\"bg-white border border-foreground/10 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-foreground/20 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-background-elevated flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm\">The Art of Plating: Creating Visual Masterpieces</span></div><div class=\"p-6\"><span class=\"text-primary text-xs font-medium\">Cooking Techniques</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-3 line-clamp-2\">The Art of Plating: Creating Visual Masterpieces</h3><p class=\"text-foreground-muted text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3\">Discover how professional chefs transform simple ingredients into stunning visual presentations that elevate the dining experience.</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-xs text-foreground-subtle\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline po